stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Disconnected

    Disconnected --> Connected : User Links
    Connected --> Disconnected : Unlink/Fail
    Connected --> Error : Sync Error
    Connected --> TokenExpired : Token Expires
    Error --> Connected : Retry
    Error --> Disconnected : Max Retries
    TokenExpired --> ReAuthenticating : Re-auth
    ReAuthenticating --> Connected : OAuth Success
    ReAuthenticating --> Disconnected : OAuth Fail

    note right of Disconnected
        Initial state, no OAuth tokens
    end note

    note right of Connected
        Valid access token, active sync
    end note

    note right of TokenExpired
        Refresh token regeneration needed
    end note

    note right of Error
        API/Network failure
    end note

    note right of ReAuthenticating
        New OAuth flow initiated
    end note